# ESPHome for esp-component.yml's esphome job (esphome config, validating the
# ESPHome external component against firmware/esphome/tests/iclforge-test.yaml).
# Regenerate the lock after any change here or in requirements-esphome.overrides.txt with:
#   uv pip compile requirements-esphome.in --override requirements-esphome.overrides.txt \
#     --generate-hashes --python-version 3.14 --python-platform linux \
#     -o requirements-esphome.txt
# (pip-compile cannot do this: it has no equivalent of --override.) The job installs the lock with
# `pip install --require-hashes --no-deps`, because esphome pins two of its own dependencies to
# versions the overrides move: see requirements-esphome.overrides.txt.
esphome
